&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=eba676449ebcf3abb890fe3971357917 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a978b46d/uploads/origins/af5dbd3c-1f85-4f85-b1a1-69c02265c2af?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=643a41b2b57e4520f43bbcdb3aa58958 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "一旦キャンセルしてから再度リクエストを送ってしまい申し訳ありません。\nまた、突然のご連絡失礼致します。  \n\n17liveという配信プラットフォームにてVliverとして活動している桃宮しゃろと申します。\n 配信のプライズに使用するイラストを描いてくださる方を探しており、その中でもちた様の絵柄が非常に好みだったためお声かけさせていただきました。  \n【仕様】 \n350dpi \n182×257mm \nPSDファイルで透過データありだと嬉しいです。 \n 【使用用途】\n・Twitter、YouTubeサムネイルに使用 \n・配信のギフティングに対する還元プライズ \n(Tシャツ、ポストカード、マグカップ等グッズを製作させて頂きたいです。直接販売等は行いません。) \n使用不可の範囲がある場合はPSDにて別レイヤーに記載をしていただけますと幸いです。   \n\n【リクエスト内容】\n下記のキャラクターデザインを使用したイラストをお願い致します。 https://photos.app.goo.gl/aWZLsyQsi1aH8x4w6  \n\nまたコスプレなど衣装チェンジや改変は自由にして頂いても大丈夫です。\n\n 他は指定ございませんので、自由に可愛く描いていただけたら嬉しいです！  \n\nお忙しい中大変恐れ入りますが、 ご検討の程何卒よろしくお願いいたします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@MotitaNeyu/works/5", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/e4c83312/uploads/origins/d9540691-ce17-49db-8123-2953d3b8b351?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7902a64b49290e48d5ff52d27bb23e2d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e4c83312/uploads/origins/d9540691-ce17-49db-8123-2953d3b8b351?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7902a64b49290e48d5ff52d27bb23e2d, https://si.imgix.net/e4c83312/uploads/origins/d9540691-ce17-49db-8123-2953d3b8b351?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a56e56085dcfcda0606a1f5819c94685 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e4c83312/uploads/origins/d9540691-ce17-49db-8123-2953d3b8b351?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0fea601b949790d643b4941f2edfe237 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！vtuberの早乙女早友梨と申します。＾＾もちたねゆ先生の絵は可愛いと思うので、依頼したいと思っています。できれば、私を描いていただけませんか。TwitchやTwitterで使うつもりです。設定などご自由で描いてください！\n\nありがとうございます。よろしくお願いいたします！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/14w-vSOgUGaMlxgWqXISgELCRcn0yv6jV?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@MotitaNeyu/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/6642d193/uploads/origins/b72cdee1-e903-4254-a97e-ab9fd03b50fe?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e277d19fac39ef3bdeda8f6b0146a025", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6642d193/uploads/origins/b72cdee1-e903-4254-a97e-ab9fd03b50fe?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e277d19fac39ef3bdeda8f6b0146a025, https://si.imgix.net/6642d193/uploads/origins/b72cdee1-e903-4254-a97e-ab9fd03b50fe?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=08b445e8fda51fd5e7099903faf90eaa 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6642d193/uploads/origins/b72cdee1-e903-4254-a97e-ab9fd03b50fe?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=23efa2c6e465e2659e67be4999bbab00 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "フロストの絵が欲しいです。ポーズやテーマは何でもOKです。以下に簡単なキャラの説明を書いておきますね。\n家族や友人といない時は中性的な顔（：< ）をしていることが多く、何を考えているのかややわかりにくい。また、強い氷の魔法を使うことができ、氷柱を作り出し、それを操ることができる。その際、角や爪、目が様々な色のオーロラで光ったり、氷そのものが光ったりする（参考資料参照）。また、見たことのない技術を見ると、冷静な性格を崩して大興奮する。この情報のどの部分も、自由に使ってください。\nフロスト： https://toyhou.se/5939989.frost/gallery#19589334\nフロストの服装参考（オプション）：https://toyhou.se/5939989.frost/7938085.clothes#25694153\n\nhttps://toyhou.se/5939989.frost/7828532.ref#28277037", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@MotitaNeyu/works/3", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/a0d810b4/uploads/origins/4f969017-3ec8-4b06-91ca-040fd261650e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5339f0fcadb06cac681f2f16a2f929ec", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a0d810b4/uploads/origins/4f969017-3ec8-4b06-91ca-040fd261650e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5339f0fcadb06cac681f2f16a2f929ec, https://si.imgix.net/a0d810b4/uploads/origins/4f969017-3ec8-4b06-91ca-040fd261650e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bb59f8d73668a4937fd8ef83681be171 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a0d810b4/uploads/origins/4f969017-3ec8-4b06-91ca-040fd261650e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=82d7b72ab37169300e44fd93625c5442 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Nice to meet you. My name is Minato Ragi and I am a VTuber on YouTube.\nThank you for your appeal!\nI would love to have you draw an illustration of me as a VTuber, so I have made this request!\nI would like to leave the composition to you, and would appreciate it if you could draw it freely.\n\nUsage\nI would like to use your illustration as a thumbnail for my Youtube videos and on various social networking sites.\n\nFormat\nWe would like to use your illustrations for thumbnails and other purposes.\nIf possible, we would appreciate it if you could provide us with separate data for the background and the characters (transparent background).\nIt would be greatly appreciated if you could provide the data in PSD format.\n\nThank you in advance for your cooperation.\n\n----------\n\nminato ragi)\nTwitter : https://twitter.com/minato_ragi\nYouTube : https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC68G7CKwETqspxyNeMb7FiA\n\nAge : 20s\nHeight : about 160cm\nGender : Female\nAppearance : Elf ears, teardrops, and a marimo cocoon\nPhysique: slender\nPersonality: calm\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1tDIAnWikV0AcyWAA9x2Gcf0mBNgiOsqu", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@MotitaNeyu/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/6678570f/uploads/origins/79c61959-8e90-4a61-81ad-08893aaa7275?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4b9c2aaf2a4c7d657d2243cd38857103", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6678570f/uploads/origins/79c61959-8e90-4a61-81ad-08893aaa7275?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4b9c2aaf2a4c7d657d2243cd38857103, https://si.imgix.net/6678570f/uploads/origins/79c61959-8e90-4a61-81ad-08893aaa7275?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=814634f0210e70e2ffe71019d27d655b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6678570f/uploads/origins/79c61959-8e90-4a61-81ad-08893aaa7275?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=19d8112c2cbcb6bd200071487ae7a5a2 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hii there! Can you draw my OC please? Expression and pose is up to you, but something warm and fluffy please <3\n\nMy model: https://drive.google.com/drive/u/2/folders/1ug7T609cNdjhKRUhAT3LcS3b-evlK_go", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@MotitaNeyu/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/21b9ec5e/uploads/origins/41ba5e19-3549-43de-a053-5b035aa0d55a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6e3b36bd45a8f266f4cde98ea7c88165", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/21b9ec5e/uploads/origins/41ba5e19-3549-43de-a053-5b035aa0d55a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6e3b36bd45a8f266f4cde98ea7c88165, https://si.imgix.net/21b9ec5e/uploads/origins/41ba5e19-3549-43de-a053-5b035aa0d55a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=05c09868a0fcfa55da86333290c71208 2x, https://si.imgix.net/21b9ec5e/uploads/origins/41ba5e19-3549-43de-a053-5b035aa0d55a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=87aed80df1fc84f5bb44ec0939f4d42f 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Good evening, I saw your SD illustration and thought it was so cute...! I saw an SD illustration and thought it was really cute...!\nShe is a transforming heroine named \"Metelite Lumiera\", and the following design materials have been approved for use in your request.\n\nDesign description\nPlease refer to the URL at the bottom for the main design.\nThe following are characteristic elements.\nThe motif of her personality and atmosphere is \"friendly, kind, cute, and neat\". She is a pure and straight girl of high school age.\nShe has long, slender eyelashes and a girlish to slightly mature face.\nHer eyes are highlighted with yellow stars.\nThe hair ornament, tiara, and white fluffy ornaments on her head are all attached independently.\nThe back of her hair is gathered inward at the neck, and then parted outward around her back. The silhouette of the mid-back hair is intended to look like the wings of an angel.\nThe dress on the torso and the ruffles on the arms are independent decorations.\nThe long skirt of the dress is gradated from red to pale pink toward the bottom.\nThe front side of the white mini-skirt is decorated with three-tiered white ribbons and pearls at both ends.\nWe will leave all unknown points, omission or simplification of costumes and decorations to you.\n\n[Composition and pose]\nSD illustrations as specified during the appeal, please!\nDetailed interpretations of the above designs and methods of expression are left up to us. We will also leave all composition and poses up to you.\nThe general atmosphere we would like to see is that of a cute Lumieira-chan!\n\nUsage\nI would like to add the illustration to my Twitter moment. I may also use it for icons and headers.\nThe illustration may be quoted when making a request to a third party using the above moments.\n\nOther\nWe would like to receive the illustration in PSD format. We have PSD viewing environment.\n\nThank you very much for your time and consideration.\n\nReference Materials\nList Moments\nhttps://twitter.com/i/events/1504333386080731137\n\n\"Metelite Lumière\" Document\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1R_7FRbYG77T3sc0tkw8bWyffu4srwO1A?usp=sharing\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1R_7FRbYG77T3sc0tkw8bWyffu4srwO1A?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}